# Form: shared user glossary

Use only when linked guides need stable translated terminology and no adequate
existing term owner exists. Default: `docs/guides/glossary.md`; a short guide may
keep its term table in the primary instead. Copy payload only and fill
[metadata](../../references/metadata.md). Meaning and exact technical token are
essential; remove unused languages/rows and add only real project terms, not a
second runtime message-code database. A placeholder row is not an approved term.

